  <h2>Our Point of View</h2>
  <p>
    The best connections are not measured by endless scrolling. They come from curiosity, presence,
    and the small moments that make someone feel real. M8tcha is built around that belief: discover
    with intention, talk before assumptions take over, and make room for chemistry to develop.
  </p>

  <h2>Built for Real Life</h2>
  <p>
    M8tcha helps people discover nearby communities, start live conversations, and find reasons to
    meet in the world around them. We are continuing to build the product around trust, useful
    context, and respectful participation.
